WEBVTT

00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:15,630
What are your thoughts on bitter apricot kernels for cancer? How many can it should be eaten?

00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:29,550
The bitter apricot kernels are a source of B17. Typically, I don't test for those when I test

00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:37,870
people. I test for just the B17. So it's just you have to eat a lot of bitter apricot kernels, like 20

00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:48,670
or 30 of them to get really a dose of B17 for cancer. It's typically much easier to swallow to

00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:57,630
capsules. That's 500 milligrams. So I don't remember how many milligrams of B17 are in each

00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:03,630
apricot kernel. You have to look that up. I think it says it. We sell the apricot kernels on our

00:01:03,630 --> 00:01:11,870
store. I think it does say somewhere where how much milligrams B17 are in that.

